[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/world/item_def.gd" id="1_item"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_item")
id = &"lore_lamps_remember"
display_name = "On Lamps That Remember"
spine_colour = Color(0.45, 0.14, 0.12, 1)
text = "[i]Placeholder text: replace or approve.[/i]

A keeper's notebook. Each page is one lamp: where it hangs, the oil it takes, the day it was last trimmed.

\"A lamp that is tended learns the hand that tends it,\" the keeper writes. \"Leave one alone for a season and it forgets the room. Leave it for years and the room forgets it.\"

Near the end the entries grow short. The last reads: [i]Gallery, west, second from the stair. Still lit. I do not know who is trimming it.[/i]"
